  Features:
  - Scans in Passive Mode (no active scan requests sent).
  - Logs MAC address, first seen, last seen, last 10 RSSI values.
  - Decodes Service Data (Battery %, Temp, Heart Rate).
  - Saves records to ESP32 Flash Memory (SPIFFS) as a JSON file.
  - Prints the file contents back to the Serial Monitor for verification.
  - Runs 100% locally on the Serial Monitor (No website/dashboard needed).
